{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Implement the complete `Span` interface.** Current OpenTelemetry API versions define abstract `Span.add_link()`, but this subclass omits it. Since the package permits unbounded `opentelemetry-api>=1.20.0`, constructing `DurableParentSpan` can raise `TypeError`, leaving both plugins unable to initialize telemetry. Add a no-op `add_link(context, attributes=None)` implementation and test construction against a current supported OTel release.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7qj8ii","finding_digest":"7ce2bec4df5784259f0decdbf767bff2fb67085f181a6d47c93d85e841a85e45","finding_id":"arf_v1_ptrl5rg7k6cclhyn5tn7oz576l","finding_key":"otel/durable_parent_span.py::durableparentspan::span-api-completeness","identity_key":"otel/durable_parent_span.py::durableparentspan::span-api-completeness","line":34,"observation_digest":"51a6d0181c4bce32eade2f10f02c03410716e9d60a4ab56516905c2e1538123a","observation_id":"aro_v1_kgtnaga4jphdf2w6f4ipaladie","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_otel/durable_parent_span.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ptrl5rg7k6cclhyn5tn7oz576l","published_at":"2026-09-04T15:05:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xxhfljo526ebnehzuuqly552b6","reviewed_base_sha":"f560c4a1c532702196337e61ed897d2586ae7a63","reviewed_head_sha":"d2b20cb219dcdaf60ad9ec1cc9c27a9ed4599a83","reviewer":"codex","start_line":34,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":696},"record_id":"art_v1_tkywcfpyr6babofi6ctgb27goa","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-04T15:05:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
